# Accessibility — required

| Element | Required |
|---|---|
| Icon-only buttons | `aria-label` |
| Form inputs | `id` + `htmlFor` + `aria-describedby` for errors |
| Overlays | `role`, `aria-modal`, focus trap, Escape closes |
| Checkbox/switch | `aria-checked` |
| Loading | `aria-busy="true"` + `aria-label` |
| Error | `aria-invalid="true"` + `aria-describedby` |

Keyboard minimum: Tab navigates · Enter/Space activates · Escape closes · Arrows in menus/groups.

Run `@storybook/addon-a11y` panel — fix all red violations before PR.
